{
  "type": "excalidraw",
  "version": 2,
  "source": "https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=pomdtr.excalidraw-editor",
  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "9KSn5OElVYJFPE6m1TC2Y",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 362.203125,
      "y": 211.28125,
      "width": 1439.038818359375,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1212728017,
      "version": 230,
      "versionNonce": 1828151862,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785687536353,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We want to give our models a shading effect. For that purpose, we can start using one of the most basic shading algorithms: the FLAT SHADING.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We want to give our models a shading effect. For that purpose, we can start using one of the most basic shading algorithms: the FLAT SHADING.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cihU9Fqd6vCgjRBu7nCrT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 294.90234375,
      "y": 274.81640625,
      "width": 1369.9388427734375,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1922450705,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 262245841,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785524431284,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "It assumes that the perceived brightness at a point on a surface is the sum of three components: ambient, diffuse, and specular reflection,\neach scaled by a weighting factor to control its influence.\n\n    - The ambient term models indirect light — the constant background illumination present even in shadowed areas.\n    - The diffuse term represents light scattered equally in all directions from rough surfaces.\n    - The specular term simulates bright highlights on shiny surfaces caused by mirror-like reflection.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "It assumes that the perceived brightness at a point on a surface is the sum of three components: ambient, diffuse, and specular reflection,\neach scaled by a weighting factor to control its influence.\n\n    - The ambient term models indirect light — the constant background illumination present even in shadowed areas.\n    - The diffuse term represents light scattered equally in all directions from rough surfaces.\n    - The specular term simulates bright highlights on shiny surfaces caused by mirror-like reflection.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pQle03hpqC7MnTyvoY6an",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 278.63831328229116,
      "y": 490.4025302814504,
      "width": 404.49651841862317,
      "height": 57.535395868236044,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1105924095,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 784895775,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785524445592,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What do we need?",
      "fontSize": 46.02831669458883,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What do we need?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "eckjq0L-M4nIci-CQRM7q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 370.2039825931882,
      "y": 573.0292234432701,
      "width": 868.6392822265625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 93885279,
      "version": 120,
      "versionNonce": 1953468031,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785524472360,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "First, we define an ambient light colour. It'll be the colour the model will have by default.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "First, we define an ambient light colour. It'll be the colour the model will have by default.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
